"pointing to instruction memory, with the length specified by ``len``, which "
"should be 0-31 (1-32 chunks, units of 128 bytes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:810
msgid "Raw Buffer Atomic Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:812
msgid ""
"These builtins perform an atomic read-modify-write on a location addressed "
"through a buffer resource, and return the value that was in memory before "
"the operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:816
msgid ""
"The buffer resource is passed as ``__amdgpu_buffer_rsrc_t``, which can be "
"created with ``__builtin_amdgcn_make_buffer_rsrc``. The address is formed "
"from the resource base plus ``offset`` and ``soffset``; the ``raw`` "
"addressing form does not take a record index."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:821
msgid ""
"Each builtin requires the target feature listed in its description, and is "
"only available when that feature is enabled for the target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:825
msgid "``__builtin_amdgcn_raw_ptr_buffer_atomic_fadd_f64``"
msgstr ""

