#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3410
msgid ""
"Returns the value of ``src`` held by the lane identified by ``idx``. This is "
"a high-level wave shuffle operation that is correctly lowered for both "
"wave32 and wave64 without requiring the caller to compute byte offsets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3414
msgid ""
"If the index is outside the valid range ``[0, wavefront_size)``, it wraps "
"around modulo the wavefront size. Reading from an inactive lane returns a "
"nondeterministic value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3421
msgid "Wave Intrinsic Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3423
msgid ""
"These builtins expose wave-level intrinsics that operate across active lanes "
"in a wavefront."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3427
msgid "``__builtin_amdgcn_wave_match_b32``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3435
msgid "**Target Features:** wave-match-insts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:3437
msgid ""
"Returns a 32-bit bitmask whose bit N is set iff lane N is active and its "
"``src0`` equals the current lane's ``src1``. Passing the same value as both "
"operands yields the mask of active lanes sharing that value. In wave64 mode "
"each 32-lane half is handled independently."
msgstr ""

